      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "mZVEJ",
          "name": "Title",
          "fill": "#161616",
          "content": "B · Context in a capped box, form always in view",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 20,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Ix4aj",
          "name": "Note",
          "fill": "#3d3d3d",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• The context box takes the rows the form does not need, and scrolls inside itself (wheel over it, or shift+↑↓). A '↓ 9 more lines' footer says there is more. The form never scrolls out of view.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "WYsxJ",
          "name": "Note",
          "fill": "#3d3d3d",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• The context is drawn as markdown: a bold lead, labelled sections, bullets with a hanging indent and dimmed code.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "ag9TN",
          "name": "Note",
          "fill": "#3d3d3d",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• Question, options, keys hint and buttons always sit in view; only the context box gives up rows.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "O66cf8",
          "name": "Note",
          "fill": "#3d3d3d",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• The steps strip shows progress only: a dot per question (answered, current, to do), the current question's name and 'question 2 of 3'. No Submit item; you submit from the last page's button.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
